# This directory is committed EMPTY on purpose: every *.txt dropped here is
# gitignored (see .gitignore) and stays a local-only input.
#
# Any *.txt file in this directory is loaded by the raw_file source in
# src/onomatron/scraper/sources.py (one name per line, UTF-8), whatever its
# name. On a fresh clone the directory is empty and run_scraper.py simply
# reports "no .txt files in data/external" — not an error.
